    "itemBodyHtml": "\n        <div class=\"row abbi-generic\">\n            <div class=\"span6\">\n                <div class=\"passage-scrolling passage440\">\n                    <div id=\"extractableContent\">\n                        <p>\n                            <b>Text Evidence from “Mapping the Invisible”</b>\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            <span id=\"Text1\">“Most maps show places you can visit and how to get there.”</span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            <span id=\"Text2\">“Dark matter is literally the darkest stuff imaginable. It neither produces nor reflects light, which means it’s invisible to human eyes and to most scientific instruments.”</span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            <span id=\"Text3\">“Making up the known (and knowable) part of the universe, ordinary matter includes you, your dog, Earth, the sun, stars and planets.”</span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            <span id=\"Text4\">“(A light-year is the distance traveled by light in one year, about <nobr>25 million</nobr> times the distance from Earth to the moon.)”</span>\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            <span id=\"Text5\">By studying how the light changed as it traveled through space, the astronomers could estimate the rough location and shape of dark matter clumps.”</span>\n                        </p>\n                        <br/>\n                        <br/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"span6\">\n                <p>Read each claim made by the author of “Mapping the Invisible.” Which text evidence shown in the left panel supports each claim?</p>\n                <p>Drag one piece of text evidence from the left panel into each evidence box.</p>\n                \n\n\t<div data-module=\"CustomInteraction-textextractor\" data-identifier=\"RESPONSE\"></div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n                       <div id=\"bays\">\n\t\t\t\t\t <div class=\"Header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Claim 1</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"1\">\n                        <tbody>\n                        <tr><td width=\"600px\" height=\"80px\">Dark matter is difficult to study.</td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n                        </table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><p><font size=\"15\">&#8595;</font></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"Header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Evidence</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td width=\"600px\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bay1\" class=\"int-ext-dropBay\" style=\"height: 80px; margin-top: 0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"Header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Claim 2</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"1\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr><td width=\"600px\" height=\"80px\">Scientists have located dark matter.</td></tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><p><font size=\"15\">&#8595;</font></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"Header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Evidence</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td width=\"600px\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"bay2\" class=\"int-ext-dropBay\" style=\"height:80px; margin-top: 0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    \n",
